  "description": "“Are you trying to shake my mentality and take away the top spot in the entire school?” \n\nGaonnuri is the best specialized school where a path to success is guaranteed for its graduates. The top student here is not someone from a single family, but Ji-Ye, who came from an orphanage. On the outside, she wears the mask of a kind and pretty child who studies well, but inside, she is the queen of hypocrisy whose only goal is success. On the first day of the new semester, Seung-Jun, the third son of the country’s top hotel conglomerate and who looks like the main character of a pure love comic, confesses to Ji-Ye, whose heart starts to pound at the unexpected declaration of war…\n\n(Source: Peanutoon, translated)",
